30,2,1,talk,Kenji,,It seems people struggle to be strict with each other. Even the station block ended up arguing over a broken latch.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've learned that enclosed houses can smell quite terrible in the summer, and supervising the bins takes nearly an hour.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The paperwork for a permanent build is extensive, and the supervision time is a significant commitment for each household.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"It's not fair! One house has complained way more because it's always at their gate, and some frontages are too narrow.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The costs are higher than one might think, though there is a subsidy. We also spend quite a bit on maintenance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the location is the problem, maybe moving it would help everyone get along?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, if the supervision is too long, perhaps we should avoid that option?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if the maintenance costs are already high for an open point, a permanent structure might just add more expenses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, yes! If it moves, then nobody is the only one stuck with the smell.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, we must consider both the financial burden and the emotional weight on our neighbors.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I just don't want us fighting over who cleans a latch or who is late with a bag.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A rotating spot sounds like it could be very fair, though we must be careful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Rotating would require frequent notices to the ward, which is a bureaucratic hassle.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,But it's better than one person being unhappy for years!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,Patience and fairness are the pillars of a good neighborhood.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
