55,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"We have an Enclosed Structure, Rotating Location, or Managed Collection Hours. I think Rotating is the friendliest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The Enclosed Structure sounds like it might smell in August. I prefer the Rotating Location.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Managed Hours is too much work, and Enclosed is too much paperwork. I vote for Rotating Location.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Rotating is the only one that is actually equal for our gates! I vote Rotating Location.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Given the costs and the need for harmony, Rotating Location seems the most balanced choice.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Kenji,,Everyone seems to agree!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief to find a path we all like.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It is the most logical choice given the constraints.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! No more complaining for just one house!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Servas,,A wise consensus reached through open hearts.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
